WEBVTT

00:03:28.663 --> 00:03:32.597
and two, we can also
not just go through this,

00:03:32.597 --> 00:03:34.330
but grow through this.

00:03:34.363 --> 00:03:38.030
And there's the possibility
of post-traumatic growth also

00:03:38.063 --> 00:03:41.297
that I think is so important
during these tough times.

00:03:41.597 --> 00:03:42.897
CSB: Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:45.363
Let's bring up a question
from our audience.

00:03:45.397 --> 00:03:46.663
OK, so someone asked,

00:03:46.663 --> 00:03:47.930
"Having lost a daughter,

00:03:47.963 --> 00:03:51.697
how do I explain my grieving process
to those who don't understand

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:53.197
but want to?"

00:03:53.697 --> 00:03:56.563
DK: You know, the reality is,

00:03:56.597 --> 00:03:59.230
people often, as hard as they try,

00:03:59.263 --> 00:04:02.330
may not understand our grief.